    <string name="sync_explain">Documents to sign, the signature, stamps, library pages, notes and AI settings (keys included) stay the same on the phone and on the computer, over your home Wi‑Fi: no cloud, everything encrypted. The phone syncs by itself when it is on the same network and OpenSlate is open on the computer. Anything removed or overwritten goes to the trash, nothing is lost.</string>
